# Bushy Bodyguard: "To forage, exile three cards from your graveyard or sacrifice a Food." Bot1 casts a Heaped Harvest (a Food) with a
# Black Lotus, declining its search; the graveyard holds only the Lotus, so exiling three cards is not offered and the only way is to
# sacrifice the Food. Bot1 accepts: the Harvest is sacrificed (its own trigger, declined) and the Bodyguard gets two counters, a 4/3.

